# Settings' fourth knob, Voices (0.14.12): DY swaps the thirty built-in DX voices for the human-made set. The pluck on a DX voice plays on
# through the switch (the engine loads the other set's patch between chunks), the setting is read back, and the switch back works.
seed 0
wait 500
setpar 98 80
setpar 99 12
wait 1000
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
expect fxpage 18
expect dyvoices 0
spin K4 1
wait 100
expect dyvoices 1
peakreset
wait 4000
expect peak_db_min -40
shot dyvoices.png
spin K4 -1
wait 100
expect dyvoices 0
peakreset
wait 4000
expect peak_db_min -40
